[[1," ٱقْرَأْ بِٱسْمِ رَبِّكَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ","Recite in the name of your Lord who created","Iqra/ bi-ismi rabbika allathee khalaq",597,30,0],[2,"خَلَقَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ مِنْ عَلَقٍ","Created man from a clinging substance.","Khalaqa al-insana min AAalaq",597,30,0],[3,"ٱقْرَأْ وَرَبُّكَ ٱلْأَكْرَمُ","Recite, and your Lord is the most Generous -","Iqra/ warabbuka al-akram",597,30,0],[4,"ٱلَّذِى عَلَّمَ بِٱلْقَلَمِ","Who taught by the pen","Allathee AAallama bilqalam",597,30,0],[5,"عَلَّمَ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ مَا لَمْ يَعْلَمْ","Taught man that which he knew not.","AAallama al-insana ma lamyaAAlam",597,30,0],[6,"كَلَّآ إِنَّ ٱلْإِنسَـٰنَ لَيَطْغَىٰٓ","No! [But] indeed, man transgresses","Kalla inna al-insana layatgha",597,30,0],[7,"أَن رَّءَاهُ ٱسْتَغْنَىٰٓ","Because he sees himself self-sufficient.","An raahu istaghna",597,30,0],[8,"إِنَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ ٱلرُّجْعَىٰٓ","Indeed, to your Lord is the return.","Inna ila rabbika arrujAAa",597,30,0],[9,"أَرَءَيْتَ ٱلَّذِى يَنْهَىٰ","Have you seen the one who forbids","Araayta allathee yanha",597,30,0],[10,"عَبْدًا إِذَا صَلَّىٰٓ","A servant when he prays?","AAabdan itha salla",597,30,0],[11,"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَانَ عَلَى ٱلْهُدَىٰٓ","Have you seen if he is upon guidance","Araayta in kana AAala alhuda",597,30,0],[12,"أَوْ أَمَرَ بِٱلتَّقْوَىٰٓ","Or enjoins righteousness?","Aw amara bittaqwa",597,30,0],[13,"أَرَءَيْتَ إِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰٓ","Have you seen if he denies and turns away -","Araayta in kaththaba watawalla",598,30,0],[14,"أَلَمْ يَعْلَم بِأَنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَرَىٰ","Does he not know that Allāh sees?","Alam yaAAlam bi-anna Allaha yara",598,30,0],[15,"كَلَّا لَئِن لَّمْ يَنتَهِ لَنَسْفَعًۢا بِٱلنَّاصِيَةِ","No! If he does not desist, We will surely drag him by the forelock","Kalla la-in lam yantahi lanasfaAAanbinnasiya",598,30,0],[16,"نَاصِيَةٍ كَـٰذِبَةٍ خَاطِئَةٍ","A lying, sinning forelock.","Nasiyatin kathibatin khati-a",598,30,0],[17,"فَلْيَدْعُ نَادِيَهُۥ","Then let him call his associates;","FalyadAAu nadiyah",598,30,0],[18,"سَنَدْعُ ٱلزَّبَانِيَةَ","We will call the angels of Hell.","SanadAAu azzabaniya",598,30,0],[19,"كَلَّا لَا تُطِعْهُ وَٱسْجُدْ وَٱقْتَرِب ۩","No! Do not obey him. But prostrate and draw near [to Allāh].","Kalla la tutiAAhu wasjudwaqtarib",598,30,1]]